[h2]Build 0.9.8[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*]Exosuit Framework support. With Exosuit Framework installed, the power suit becomes an Exosuit Framework suit: install it at maintenance bays to fit modules and have it repaired, with the framework's structure points and health bar.
[*]It still stands wherever you leave it: right-click a crafted suit and choose "Set up power suit here", climb in by right-clicking the standing suit, and use "Climb out here" to leave it standing on the spot. No bay needed.
[/list]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*]Without Exosuit Framework nothing changes: the suit works on its own as before.
[/list]
